Dear players
The Cronous server will undergo routine maintenance every Tuesday, during which the game will not be able to log in. To ensure the integrity of account data, please exit the game before maintenance begins. Thank you for your support and understanding.

Estimated maintenance time:
10:00-17:00 AM，Jun.25th（CST）

Maintenance and update content:
1. The sixth round of season servers will be closed, and the seventh round of season servers will be opened at 3:00 pm on June 26th;
2. The original token system settings will be replaced by the newly added credit point store;
3. Credit points are shared in the account sharing system, and can be used on both the Infinity server and season server;
4. Credit point products can be traded;
5. Credit points can only be obtained through season servers or siege activities.

Dear players The server maintenance work has been completed and the game login function has been activated. Wishing you a pleasant game.

[b]Maintenance and update content:[/b]

1. Server optimization and bug fixing;
2. Adjustment of lottery activities;
3. Steam platform client, store purchase condition change: requires 2nd master reclass transfers;
4. Illegal account suspension.
